==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 45 seconds<sup>1,350f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'noir]] spawns as the boss after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is an exact copy of [[Cram Session Failure]], so any Strategies used there will also work here.

